{
  "name": "list_provider_models",
  "title": "List provider models",
  "description": "List model candidates for one saved connection, intersecting provider metadata with verified runtime and adapter capabilities. role defaults to llm; unavailable or unverified models remain explicitly labeled and are not silently selected. refresh=false returns only cached/local metadata and performs no external request; refresh=true explicitly permits metadata discovery at the validated provider endpoint. No meeting content or generation is sent. Codex model candidates and reasoning_effort values come from the official, connection-specific runtime model/list response. OpenAI/Anthropic API and local Ollama candidates are intersected with verified adapter capabilities; unknown models may be displayed as unverified but cannot be selected for minutes generation. Only text minutes generation is added; Claude Agent SDK generation remains unavailable. parameter_schema may advertise max_tokens as an application request limit up to 32768 even when the model max_output_tokens is unknown. Keep that unknown capability null: a 4096-token application default is not a model limit. Known model output limits must also bound requests. Unavailable reasoning values are not guessed or silently replaced. Catalog observations do not increment configuration revision. cursor is an opaque page token bound to the connection/revision/catalog; invalid or stale cursors are rejected. Return null limits or pricing when unknown, never guessed capabilities or zero cost. No ambient credentials, redirects, proxies, model download or endpoint fallback is used. On failure returns an error_envelope (isError=true) with code: invalid_argument, not_found, configuration_conflict, authentication_required, engine_unavailable, model_unavailable, internal. All provider operations require the authenticated resident server; no implicit in-process or unauthenticated HTTP fallback is allowed.",
  "annotations": {
    "readOnlyHint": true,
    "destructiveHint": false,
    "idempotentHint": true,
    "openWorldHint": true
  },
